        "claim": "Unregister removes the recorded 1.x entry before jsonUninstall runs. If jsonUninstall then fails or refuses (for example the v2 entry is a foreign or conflicting one), the legacy entry is already gone and the record is not cleared. The operation is not atomic and leaves a half-unregistered state.",
